# Rendered copies of shipped guides, made for the drupal.org release node.
# The Markdown is what ships; the HTML is a local artefact.
docs/*.html
recipes/paragraphs_bundles_demo/WORKSTREAM.md

# One-off v1 -> v2 porting and migration tooling. Single-use, never invoked by
